NavigatorZones={
["Wrothgar"]={"High-Value Skill Points (10.67 Total + Solo Arena):","Collect All 17 Skyshards (5.67 Skill Points): 9 overland shards plus 8 dungeon shards—one in each of the 6 delves (Argent Mine, Coldperch Cavern, Nikolvara's Kennel, Thukhozod's Sanctum, Watcher's Hold, Zthenganaz) and 1 in each of the 2 Public Dungeons (Old Orsinium and Rkindaleft).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat the group event bosses inside Old Orsinium and Rkindaleft (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the King Kurog / Orsinium rebuilding storyline (awards 3 skill points across major quests).","Clear Maelstrom Arena (Solo Arena): Beat the 9-stage solo arena in northern Wrothgar to farm Maelstrom Destruction Staves (Crushing Wall), Maelstrom Bows (Thunderous Volley), and Maelstrom Two-Handed Weapons (Merciless Charge)—essential backbar weapons for PvE DPS.","Zone Exploration & Collectibles:","Defeat All 6 World Bosses: Corintthac the Abomination (Mad Ogre's Altar), Edu (Nyzchaleft Falls), King-Chief Edu (King-Chief's Throne), Snugar (Poacher's Encampment), Unfinished Dolmen, and Zandadunoz the Reborn (Unfinished Dolmen).","Collect 20 Museum Relics (Hero of Wrothgar): Gather all 20 relics across the zone for the House of Orsimer Glories museum to unlock 3 free Orcish costumes.","Discover All 10 Wayshrines & 19 Points of Interest.","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Briarheart (Medium—top stamina solo/crit healing set; you can get a free named dagger Materre's Bodkin from a short side quest), Trinimac's Valor (Light), and Mark of the Pariah (Heavy—top PvP tank/survivability set).","Craftable Set Stations: Forlorn Watchtower (Law of Julianos—classic craftable Magicka DPS set), Malacath's Maw (Morkuldin), and Morkul Descent (Trial by Fire)."},
["Hew's Bane"]={"High-Value Skill Points (8 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 6 Skyshards (2 Skill Points): 4 overland shards plus 2 delve shards—one in each of the 2 delves (Bahraha's Gloom and Shark's Teeth Grotto). Note: No Public Dungeons.","Complete the Thieves Guild Main Storyline (6 Skill Points): Finish the 6 main Thieves Guild quests (1 skill point per quest) and unlock the Thieves Guild passive skill line (great for reducing bounty timers, increasing fence limits, and opening Thieves Troves).","Clear Maw of Lorkhaj (12-Player Trial): Run the Trial in southern Hew's Bane to farm Roar of Alkosh (meta Tank/Support armor-shredding set), Moondancer, and Lunar Bastion.","Zone Exploration & Guild Progression:","Run Daily Heists & Kari's Hit List: Complete stealth Heist dailies (from Fa'ren-dar in the Thieves Den) to level the Thieves Guild skill line fast and earn Motif pages.","Defeat Both World Bosses: Ko Estaran (Thrall Cove) and Syvarra of the Deep (Ko Estaran / Deep).","Discover All 3 Wayshrines & 6 Points of Interest (including Abah's Landing).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Bahraha's Curse (All weights—syphon healing), Syvarra's Scales (All weights—poison AoE), and Sithis' Touch (All weights).","Craftable Set Stations: Lost Pavilion (Tava's Favor), No Shira Citadel (Clever Alchemist—meta PvP potion-burst set), and Strident Springs (Eternal Hunt)."},
["Gold Coast"]={"High-Value Skill Points (10 Total):","Collect All 6 Skyshards (2 Skill Points): 4 overland shards plus 2 delve shards—one in each of the 2 delves (Garlas Agea and Hrota Cave). Note: No Public Dungeons.","Complete the Dark Brotherhood Main Storyline (8 Skill Points): Finish the 8 main Dark Brotherhood quests (1 skill point per quest) and immediately unlock Blade of Woe (instant stealth assassination) and Shadow Rider (reduces aggro radius by 50% while mounted—one of the best open-world quality-of-life passives in ESO).","Zone Exploration & Guild Progression:","Run Daily Sacraments & Contracts: Complete stealth Sacrament dailies (from Speaker Terenus in the Dark Brotherhood Sanctuary) to level the Dark Brotherhood skill line and earn Motif pages.","Defeat Both World Bosses: Kvatch Arena (wave arena boss) and Tribune's Folly (Limenauruus the Minotaur).","Discover All 4 Wayshrines & 7 Points of Interest (including Anvil and Kvatch).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Flanking Strategist (Medium), Hide of Morihaus (Heavy), and Sithis' Touch (Light).","Craftable Set Stations: Colovian Revolt (Pelinal's Wrath), Marja's Mill (Kvatch Gladiator), and Strid River Artisans (Varen's Legacy)."},
["Vvardenfell"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 10 overland shards plus 8 dungeon shards—one in each of the 6 delves (Ashalmawia, Khartag Point, Matus-Akin Egg Mine, Nchuleft, Pulk, Zainsipilu) and 1 in each of the 2 Public Dungeons (Forgotten Wastes and Nchuleftingth).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat the group event bosses inside Forgotten Wastes and Nchuleftingth (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the Vivec / Barbas / Clockwork storyline (awards 3 skill points).","Clear Halls of Fabrication (12-Player Trial): Run the Trial in eastern Vvardenfell to farm Master Architect (meta Major Slayer support set) and War Machine.","Zone Exploration & Collectibles:","Defeat All 6 World Bosses: Dubdil Alar Tower, Missir-Dadalit Egg Mine, Nilthog's Hollow, Salothan's Council, Shipwreck Cove, and Sulipund Grange.","Complete the 28 Ancestral Tombs Quest: Find all 28 tomb rubbings across Vvardenfell and deliver them to Librarian Bradyn in Vivec City to earn a Scale Model of Vvardenfell furnishing.","Discover All 12 Wayshrines & 21 Points of Interest (including Vivec City, widely considered the fastest, most convenient daily crafting writ and banking hub in ESO).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: War Maiden (Light—boosts Magic Damage abilities, popular on Templars/Nightblades/Arcanists), Defiler (Medium), and Warrior-Poet (Heavy).","Craftable Set Stations: Holamayan Monastery (Assassin's Guile), Nchuleftingth Approach (Shacklebreaker—classic PvP stat/sustain set), and Randas Ancestral Tomb (Daedric Trickery—top PvP backbar buff set)."},
["Clockwork City"]={"High-Value Skill Points (10 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 6 Skyshards (2 Skill Points): 4 overland shards plus 2 delve shards—one in each of the 2 delves (Halls of Regulation and The Shadow Cleft). Note: No Public Dungeons.","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (8 Skill Points): Finish the 8 main Clockwork City quests (1 skill point per quest).","Clear Asylum Sanctorium (12-Player Trial): Run the fast mini-Trial to farm Asylum Destruction Staves (Concentrated Force) and Asylum Two-Handed Weapons.","Zone Exploration & Collectibles:","Build The Precursor Target Dummy (Free House Furnishing): Collect all 12 mechanical parts scattered across Clockwork City and Tamriel delves to assemble a free 323k Health Precursor target dummy for your home.","Defeat Both World Bosses: Exarchs' Egress and The Sanctuary of Verification.","Discover All 3 Wayshrines & 6 Points of Interest (including The Brass Fortress).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Mad Tinkerer (Light—summons a bowling fabricant), Unfathomable Darkness (Medium—summons crows), and Livewire (Heavy—applies Concussed).","Craftable Set Stations: Pavilion of Artifice (Fortified Brass—high armor craftable set), Restricted Brassworks (Innate Axiom), and The Venture (Mechanical Acuity—top burst crit craftable set)."},
["Summerset"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 10 overland shards plus 8 dungeon shards—one in each of the 6 delves (Archon's Grove, Eton Nir Grotto, King's Haven Pass, The Spiral Skein, Tor-Hame-Khard, Wasten Coraldale) and 1 in each of the 2 Public Dungeons (Karnwasten and Sunhold).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat the group event bosses inside Karnwasten and Sunhold (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the Crystal Tower / Nocturnal storyline (awards 3 skill points).","Clear Cloudrest (12-Player Trial): Run the mini-Trial atop Eton Nir to farm Mantle of Siroria, Vestment of Olorime (meta Healer Major Courage set), Arms of Relequen (top single-target Stamina DPS set), and Aegis of Galenwe.","Zone Unlocks, Guilds, & World Events:","Unlock Jewelry Crafting (Alinor): Speak to Felarian outside the Alinor crafting area to certify for Jewelry Crafting writs and trait research.","Unlock & Level the Psijic Order Skill Line (Artaeum): Complete the Psijic Order questline (closing time breaches across Tamriel) to unlock Channeled Acceleration (Minor Force), Meditate, and Temporal Guard / Undo (passive Minor Protection while slotted).","Clear All 6 Abyssal Geysers (World Events): Close the Pearl geyser events across Summerset for Jewelry Crafting trait materials and motifs.","Defeat All 6 World Bosses: B'Korgen (Welenkin Cove), Caanerin (Indrik Frolic), Graveld (Graveld's Hideaway), Keelsplitter (Keelsplitter's Nest), Queen of the Reef (The Queen's Hatchery), and Tideborn / Sunhold Coast.","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Wisdom of Vanus (Light), Gryphon's Ferocity (Medium), and Grace of Gloom (Heavy).","Craftable Set Stations: Knightsgrave (Nocturnal's Favor), Eldbur Ruins (Sload's Semblance), and Alinor Royal Docks / Artaeum (Adept Rider—grants permanent Major Gallop & Major Expedition, the #1 leveling/farming craftable set in ESO)."},
["Murkmire"]={"High-Value Skill Points (9 Total + 4-Player Arena):","Collect All 6 Skyshards (2 Skill Points): 4 overland shards plus 2 delve shards—one in each of the 2 delves (Tsofeer Cavern and Teeth of Sithis). Note: No Public Dungeons.","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (7 Skill Points): Finish the 7 main Murkmire quests (1 skill point per quest).","Clear Blackrose Prison (4-Player Arena): Beat the 5-stage arena to farm Blackrose Dual Wield (Spectral Cloak) (meta PvE/PvP backbar damage/mitigation weapons) and Blackrose Restoration Staff (Mender's Ward).","Zone Exploration:","Defeat Both World Bosses: Baxilt-Gah (Bok-Xul) and Walks-Like-Thunder (Sweet Breeze Overlook).","Discover All 4 Wayshrines & 6 Points of Interest (including Lilmoth).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Bright-Throat's Boast (Light—massive Max Magicka & Magicka Recovery when drink buff is active), Dead-Water's Guile (Medium—Ultimate generation on kill), and Champion of the Hist (Heavy—permanent Minor Heroism).","Craftable Set Stations: Sweet Breeze Overlook (Grave-Stake Collector), Tomb of Many Spears (Might of the Lost Legion), and Vakka-Bok Ruins (Naga Shaman)."},
["Blackwood"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 10 overland shards plus 8 dungeon shards—one in each of the 6 delves (Arpenia, Bloodrun Cave, Doomvault Porcixid, Undertow Cavern, Vunalk, Xi-Tsei) and 1 in each of the 2 Public Dungeons (The Silent Halls and Zenithar's Abbey).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat Warlord Iaza inside The Silent Halls and the group event boss inside Zenithar's Abbey (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the Mehrunes Dagon / Ambitions storyline across Leyawiin and Gideon (awards 3 skill points).","Clear Rockgrove (12-Player Trial): Run the Trial in northeastern Blackwood to farm Bahsei's Mania, Saxhleel Champion (meta Tank/Support Major Force set), Stone-Talker's Oath, and Sul-Xan's Torment.","Zone Unlocks, World Events, & Exploration:","Unlock Your First Companions: Complete the recruitment quests for Bastian Hallix (Deepscorn Hollow, southwestern coast) and Mirri Elendis (Doomvault Vulpinaz, northern Blackwood).","Clear Oblivion Portals (World Events): Enter the red portal gates that spawn across Blackwood to reach the Atoll of Immolation public instance and defeat the Daedric Duke at the end.","Defeat All 6 World Bosses: Old Deathwart's Pond, Shardius's Excavation, The Shattered Xanmeer, Sul-Xan Ritual Site, Toad-Tongue War Camp, and Xeemhok's Lagoon.","Discover All 12 Wayshrines & 9 Points of Interest (including Leyawiin, a fast crafting/banking hub).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Frostbite (Light—boosts Frost Damage, meta for Warden DPS), Deadlands Assassin (Medium), and Bog Raider (Heavy).","Craftable Set Stations: Fort Redmane (Heartland Conqueror—doubles weapon trait effectiveness, essential for leveling with Training weapons), Lair of the Hist (Hist Whisperer), and Glenbridge (Diamond's Victory)."},
["The Deadlands & Fargrave"]={"High-Value Skill Points (9 Total):","Collect All 6 Skyshards (2 Skill Points): 4 overland shards plus 2 delve shards—one in each of the 2 delves (Brandfire Reformatory and False Martyrs' Folly). Note: No Public Dungeons.","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (7 Skill Points): Finish the Fargrave / Mehrunes Dagon finale storyline (awards 7 skill points, plus unlocks the Gates of Oblivion epilogue questline if Blackwood is also completed).","Zone Exploration & World Events:","Hunt Wandering Havocrel Bosses & Oblivion Portals: Defeat the massive roaming Havocrel executioners (Blightcrown, The Pummeler, Unmaker) across the Deadlands burn for Antiquities leads and achievement rewards.","Defeat Both World Bosses: Den of the Unmaker and The Abomination Cradle.","Discover Fargrave & All Wayshrines: Explore Fargrave (which acts as the central hub connecting to The Night Market event portal and Infinite Archive via the global map).","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Hexos' Ward (Medium—grants a massive 12k+ damage shield on critical hits, top solo survivability set), Eye of the Grasp (Light), and Kynmarcher's Cruelty (Heavy).","Craftable Set Stations: Stormwright's Cleft (Wretched Vitality—the #1 PvP sustain craftable set in ESO) and The Razorworks (Deadlands Demolisher)."},
["High Isle & Amenos"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 10 overland shards plus 8 dungeon shards—one in each of the 6 delves (Breakwater Cave, Death's Valor Keep, Firepot Cave, Shipwreck Shoals, The Firepot, Whale's Fall) and 1 in each of the 2 Public Dungeons (Ghost Haven Bay on Amenos and Spire of the Crimson Coin on High Isle).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat the group event bosses inside Ghost Haven Bay and Spire of the Crimson Coin (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the Ascendant Lord / Society of the Steadfast storyline (awards 3 skill points).","Clear Dreadsail Reef (12-Player Trial): Run the Trial on the northern coast to farm Whorl of the Depths (top PvE Magicka/Hybrid proc set), Coral Riptide (top PvE Stamina DPS set), Pearlescent Ward (meta Tank group buff set), and Pillager's Profit (meta Healer Ultimate generation set).","Zone Unlocks, World Events, & Exploration:","Unlock Tales of Tribute & Two Companions: Complete the Tales of Tribute card game tutorial in Gonfalon Bay, and recruit Ember (Tor Draioch) and Isobel Veloise (Castle Navire).","Clear Volcanic Vents (World Events): Close the volcanic fissures across High Isle and Amenos for Druidic furnishing plans, Antiquities leads (including Oakensoul Ring leads), and motif pages.","Defeat All 6 World Bosses: Amenos Basin, Faun Falls, Glemyos Wilds, Mornard Falls, Serpent Bog, and Y'ffre's Cauldron.","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Systres' Scowl (Heavy), Steadfast's Mettle (Medium), and Blessing of High Isle (Light).","Craftable Set Stations: Brokerock Mine (Order's Wrath—widely considered the best all-around craftable DPS/leveling set in ESO), Old Coin Fort (Serpent's Disdain), and Stonelore Forge (Druid's Braid)."},
["Galen & Y'ffelon"]={"High-Value Skill Points (9 Total):","Collect All 6 Skyshards (2 Skill Points): 4 overland shards plus 2 delve shards—one in each of the 2 delves (Embervine and Fauns' Thicket). Note: No Public Dungeons.","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (7 Skill Points): Finish the Druid King / Mount Firesong storyline (awards 7 skill points, plus unlocks the Legacy of the Bretons epilogue questline if High Isle is also completed).","Zone Exploration & World Events:","Clear Volcanic Vents & Defeat Both World Bosses: Close Volcanic Vents on Galen and defeat Valley of the Watcher and Grove of the Chimera.","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Back-Alley Gourmand (Light—massive Critical Damage boost while a food buff is active), Phoenix Moth Theurge (Medium), and Bastion of the Draoife (Heavy).","Craftable Set Stations: Claw's Strike / Galen Forge (Chimera's Rebuke and Old Growth Brewer)."},
["Telvanni Peninsula & Apocrypha"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 7 in Telvanni Peninsula (4 overland, 1 in Gorne Public Dungeon, 1 each in Anchre Egg Mine and Camonnaruhn delves) plus 11 in Apocrypha (6 overland, 1 in The Underweave Public Dungeon, 1 each in The Disquiet Study, Quires Wind, Fathoms Drift, and Apogee of the Tormenting Eye delves).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat the group event bosses inside Gorne (Telvanni Peninsula) and The Underweave (Apocrypha) (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the Hermaeus Mora / Torvesard storyline (awards 3 skill points across 9 story quests).","Clear Sanity's Edge (12-Player Trial): Run the Trial in Telvanni Peninsula to farm Ansuul's Torment (meta PvE DPS set), Transformative Hope, Peace and Serenity, and Test of Resolve.","Zone Unlocks, World Events, & Exploration:","Unlock Two Companions: Recruit Sharp-as-Night (outside Necrom) and Azandar al-Cybiades (Cipher's Midden in Apocrypha).","Clear Bastion Nymic (4-Player World Events): Collect 5 Ichor from Herald's Seekers in the overland, then enter a Bastion Nymic portal for a mini-dungeon boss encounter.","Defeat All 6 World Bosses: Clamorclap Bowl and Nightmare Den in Telvanni Peninsula, plus 4 World Bosses in Apocrypha.","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Vivec's Duality (Light), Camonna Tong (Medium), and Adamant Lurker (Heavy).","Craftable Set Stations: Tel Hlurag Ven (Telvanni Efficiency—cuts Companion cooldowns by 50%), Artisan's Hermitage (Shattered Fate—12-piece massive penetration/stat set), and Versicolor Carrels (Seeker Synthesis)."},
["West Weald"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 10 overland shards plus 8 dungeon shards—one in each of the 6 delves and 1 in each of the 2 Public Dungeons (Leftwheal and Silorn).","Clear Both Public Dungeon Group Events (2 Skill Points): Defeat the group event bosses inside Leftwheal and Silorn (1 skill point each).","Complete the Zone Main Storyline (3 Skill Points): Finish the Ithelia / Recollection storyline in Skingrad (awards 3 skill points).","Clear Lucent Citadel (12-Player Trial): Run the Trial in West Weald to farm Lucent Echoes (meta Tank Critical Damage group buff set), Slivers of the Null Arca (top single-target PvE DPS set), Mora's Scribe Thesis, and Xoryn's Masterpiece.","Zone Unlocks, World Events, & Exploration:","Unlock Scribing (The Scholarium): Complete the Scribing questline in Skingrad to unlock customizable Grimoire abilities and earn Luminous Ink drops across the zone.","Clear Mirrormoor Mosaics (World Events) & 6 World Bosses: Disrupt Mirrormoor Incursions across West Weald and defeat all 6 World Bosses.","Zone-Specific Sets & Crafting Stations:","Overland Sets: Macabre Vintage (Medium—causes enemies to explode in a blood burst on death, popular for solo/overland farming), Ayleid Refuge (Heavy), and Symmetry of the Weald (Light).","Craftable Set Stations: Highland's End / Colovian Stations (Highland Sentinel—massive Critical Chance when standing still, used for stationary parse/boss fights, plus Threads of War and Tharriker's Strike)."},
["Solstice"]={"High-Value Skill Points (11 Total + 12-Player Trial):","Collect All 18 Skyshards (6 Skill Points): 9 Skyshards in Western Solstice (including overland shards around Deetra Grotto, Vale of Revelry, Sunport, and inside delves like Carapace Cavern and Tainted Leel) plus 9 Skyshards in Eastern Solstice across the Writhing Wall.","Clear Public Dungeons & Zone Storyline: Complete the Seasons of the Worm Cult main storyline across Sunport and both halves of the island, and clear the Public Dungeon group events for bonus skill points.","Clear Ossein Cage (12-Player Trial): Run the Solstice Trial to farm endgame Trial gear and achievements.","Zone Exploration:","Discover All Wayshrines, Striking Locales, & Delves: Unlock Sunport, Shell-Tide Village, Corelanya Manor, and clear the delves (Vale of Revelry, Carapace Cavern, Tainted Leel, etc.) and World Bosses."},
["The Night Market"]={"Event Status & Structure: Unlike permanent zones, The Night Market is a recurring, free-to-play, veteran-difficulty PvE event zone accessed via the portal west of the Shambles Wayshrine in Fargrave (its inaugural Season Zero run took place April 29 – June 17, 2026, with its next opening scheduled for H1 2027).","Event To-Do Checklist (When Active):","1. Pledge to One of the Three Factions Immediately: Speak to The Curator in Starlit Plaza to complete Those Who Would Rule and pledge to Glittering Goad, The Ruckus, or Thousand Eyes (account-wide choice for that event cycle) before entering the districts.","2. Unlock the Free Night's Den House: Complete the introductory quest across the three districts (Skittering Precinct, Sorrow's Friend, and The Part) to unlock the Night's Den 700-slot player home.","3. Collect 30 Relic Splinters (10 per District): Defeat Skirmish, Argent, and Brazen bosses, buy the vendor splinter (500 Favor + 1,000 Gold), and open daily coffers to assemble all three district relics.","4. Clear the 3 Gilded Bosses & The Opulent Ordeal (12-Player Trial): Use your assembled relics and Argent boss keys to defeat the three 4-player Gilded bosses, unlocking the 12-player Opulent Ordeal encounter.","5. Farm Faction Favor (Up to 10,000): Complete daily quests to unlock Monster Set headpieces, Trade Bars, furnishings, and faction placement rewards"},
